  "label": "Black Lives Matter Movement",
  "description": "The phrase 'black lives matter' is a social and political movement founded in 2013 to combat systemic racism and police brutality against Black people. The meme's sarcastic text '>\"how\",\"why\"and \"to whom\" is unclear' is a direct attempt to undermine this movement by implying its message is irrelevant or hypocritical, which requires understanding the movement's real-world context and goals.",
